### My current assignments — 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me/assignments?courseId={{manual_course_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{manual_student_token}}

### My graded submissions — 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me/submissions?courseId={{manual_course_id}}&status=GRADED
Authorization: Bearer {{manual_student_token}}

### My quiz attempt history — 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me/quiz-attempts?courseId={{manual_course_id}}&status=SUBMITTED&page=0&size=1
Authorization: Bearer {{manual_student_token}}

### Withdraw from course — 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/courses/{{manual_course_id}}/enrollments/me
Authorization: Bearer {{manual_student_token}}

### Progress history retained — 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me/progress?courseId={{manual_course_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{manual_student_token}}

### Restore enrollment — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/courses/{{manual_course_id}}/enrollments
Authorization: Bearer {{manual_student_token}}

# OpenAPI

### OpenAPI document — 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/v3/api-docs
Accept: application/json

### Swagger UI static page — 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/swagger-ui/index.html
Accept: text/html

# Quiz expiration

### Create module for expiration test — 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/courses/{{manual_course_id}}/modules
Authorization: Bearer {{manual_teacher_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Quiz expiration","description":"Timed quiz","position":2}

> {%
    if (response.status === 201) client.global.set("manual_expiry_module_id", String(response.body.id));
%}

### Create one-minute quiz — 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/modules/{{manual_expiry_module_id}}/quiz
Authorization: Bearer {{manual_teacher_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Timed quiz","timeLimit":1}

> {%
    if (response.status === 201) {
        client.global.set("manual_expiry_quiz_id", String(response.body.id));
        client.global.set("manual_expiry_quiz_version", String(response.body.version));
    }
%}

### Set one permitted attempt — 200
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/quizzes/{{manual_expiry_quiz_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{manual_teacher_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":{{manual_expiry_quiz_version}},"title":"Timed quiz","timeLimit":1,"maxAttempts":1}

### Create question for timed quiz — 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/quizzes/{{manual_expiry_quiz_id}}/questions
Authorization: Bearer {{manual_teacher_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"text":"Which type is primitive?","type":"SINGLE_CHOICE","position":1,"options":[{"text":"int","correct":true},{"text":"String","correct":false}]}

### Start timed attempt — 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/quizzes/{{manual_expiry_quiz_id}}/attempts
Authorization: Bearer {{manual_student_token}}

> {%
    if (response.status === 201) client.global.set("manual_expiry_attempt_id", String(response.body.id));
%}

# Execute the following requests after expiresAt has passed.

### Read expired attempt — 200, EXPIRED
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/quizzes/{{manual_expiry_quiz_id}}/attempts/{{manual_expiry_attempt_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{manual_student_token}}

### Reject submission after expiry — 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/quizzes/{{manual_expiry_quiz_id}}/attempts/{{manual_expiry_attempt_id}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{manual_student_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"answers":[]}

### Reject new attempt after limit is exhausted — 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/quizzes/{{manual_expiry_quiz_id}}/attempts
Authorization: Bearer {{manual_student_token}}

# Overdue assignment and deadline reopening

### Create assignment with a near deadline — 201
< {%
    client.global.set("manual_short_due", new Date(Date.now() + 120000).toISOString());
%}
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/lessons/{{manual_lesson_id}}/assignments
Authorization: Bearer {{manual_teacher_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Deadline reopening","description":"Submit after the deadline is extended","dueAt":"{{manual_short_due}}","maxScore":100}

> {%
    if (response.status === 201) {
        client.global.set("manual_overdue_assignment_id", String(response.body.id));
        client.global.set("manual_overdue_assignment_version", String(response.body.version));
    }
%}

### Gradebook before deadline — 200, no overdue assignment
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/courses/{{manual_course_id}}/gradebook?type=ASSIGNMENT&reviewStatus=OVERDUE&moduleId={{manual_module_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{manual_teacher_token}}

# Execute after dueAt has passed.

### Gradebook after deadline — 200, assignment overdue
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/courses/{{manual_course_id}}/gradebook?type=ASSIGNMENT&reviewStatus=OVERDUE&moduleId={{manual_module_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{manual_teacher_token}}

### Reopen assignment by extending deadline — 200
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/lessons/{{manual_lesson_id}}/assignments/{{manual_overdue_assignment_id}}/deadline
Authorization: Bearer {{manual_teacher_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"dueAt":"{{manual_extended_due}}","version":{{manual_overdue_assignment_version}}}

### Submit homework after deadline extension — 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/{{manual_overdue_assignment_id}}/submissions
Authorization: Bearer {{manual_student_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"content":"Submission after deadline extension"}

# Session lifecycle

### Change student password — 204
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{manual_student_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"currentPassword":"{{test_password}}","newPassword":"{{new_password}}"}

### Previous JWT rejected after password change — 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{manual_student_token}}

### Login with changed password — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"{{manual_student_email}}","password":"{{new_password}}"}

> {%
    if (response.status === 200) client.global.set("manual_student_token", String(response.body.accessToken));
%}

### Logout student — 204
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{manual_student_token}}

### Logged out JWT rejected — 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{manual_student_token}}

# Password recovery by email
# Use an unused mailbox address for this account. Run the requests in this section individually.

### Register password recovery user — 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"displayName":"Password recovery test","email":"{{reset_email}}","password":"{{test_password}}"}

> {%
    if (response.status === 201) client.global.set("manual_reset_user_id", String(response.body.id));
%}

### Login before password reset — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"{{reset_email}}","password":"{{test_password}}"}

> {%
    if (response.status === 200) client.global.set("manual_reset_old_token", String(response.body.accessToken));
%}

### Request password reset email — 202
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"{{reset_email}}"}

### Request reset for unknown email — 202
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"unknown-{{$uuid}}@example.com"}

### Reset password using the token from email — 204
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{"token":"{{reset_token}}","newPassword":"{{new_password}}"}

### Reject previously issued JWT — 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{manual_reset_old_token}}

### Reject old password after reset — 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"{{reset_email}}","password":"{{test_password}}"}

### Login with reset password — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"{{reset_email}}","password":"{{new_password}}"}

### Reject used reset token — 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{"token":"{{reset_token}}","newPassword":"{{reset_final_password}}"}

# Wait for the two-minute email cooldown before requesting another reset link.

### Admin sends password reset email — 202
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{manual_reset_user_id}}/password-reset
Authorization: Bearer {{manual_admin_token}}

### Reset password using the administrator-requested link — 204
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{"token":"{{admin_reset_token}}","newPassword":"{{reset_final_password}}"}

### Login after administrator-requested reset — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"{{reset_email}}","password":"{{reset_final_password}}"}
